Plot Spectrum analyzer (Qt port from Audacity 3.7.9)

Reintroduces Analyze → Plot Spectrum for Audacity 4 / DRT as a Qt/QML
dialog. Reuses au3 PlotSpectrumBase + SpectrumAnalyst for FFT math,
and wires the existing plot-spectrum action into the Analyze menu.

Features: spectrum / autocorrelation / cepstrum algorithms, FFT size,
window function, linear/log axis, grid, zoom/pan, cursor/peak readout,
replot, and export to spectrum.txt. Prefs use the same
/FrequencyPlotDialog/* keys as 3.7.9.

Apply against an Audacity 4.x tree:
  git apply 0005-plot-spectrum.patch

